OL,3,GUK five day outlook
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FUnsettled at first, with spells of
OL,7,Frain and some heavy showers,
OL,8,Fespecially in northern areas.
OL,9,FConditions gradually improve later,
OL,10,Fbecoming drier for many. Hot in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast, cooler further north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
